1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
안 한 날은 버린 날인 줄 알았어요.
I used to think a day of doing nothing was a day thrown away.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,306
존 러벅은 말했어요.
John Lubbock wrote,

3
00:00:06,406 --> 00:00:13,591
구름을 보며 누워 있는 것도 낭비가 아니라고.
"Rest is not idleness… watching the clouds float across the sky,
is by no means a waste of time."

4
00:00:13,691 --> 00:00:19,711
휴일 내내 누웠다가 저녁에 철렁한 날.
A holiday spent lying down, and by evening your heart sinks.

5
00:00:19,811 --> 00:00:23,500
쉬는 일을 한 걸지도요.
Maybe you didn't do nothing. You rested.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
오늘도 충분히 쉬는 일을 하셨어요.
Today, you worked enough. At resting.
